## Problem Description

Given a sequence $a_{1\sim n}$ of length $n$. There are $m$ queries, each given $op, l, r, k$:

- If $op = 0$, query how many numbers in the range $[l, r]$ are less than $k$.
- If $op = 1$, query the $k$-th smallest number in the range $[l, r]$.

